orm: scale(1.2, 2.4);\\">)</span></span></span></span><span>&nbsp;</span>​​​​​​​<br>","solution":""},{"type":"choice","article":"<span style=\\"font-size:20px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">There is a proportional relationship between <i><span class=\\"15\\">p</span></i>&nbsp;and <i><span class=\\"15\\">t</span></i>. If <i><span class=\\"15\\">p</span></i>= 2,310 when<i><span class=\\"15\\">&nbsp;t</span></i>= 3,080, then what is the value of&nbsp;&nbsp;<i><span class=\\"15\\">t</span></i>&nbsp;when <i><span class=\\"15\\">p</span></i>= 1,848?</span></span><br>","question":"","options":[{"name":"A","content":"1,078<br>"},{"name":"B","content":"1,386<br>"},{"name":"C","content":"2,464<br>"},{"name":"D","content":"2,618<br>"}],"correct":"2,464<br>","solution":""},{"type":"choice","article":"<span style=\\"font-size:20px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">The equation</span></span><span class=\\"mq-math-mode\\" latex-data=\\"y=-4.9(x-9.1)^2+12,400\\"><span class=\\"mq-textarea\\"><textarea autocapitalize=\\"off\\" autocomplete=\\"off\\" autocorrect=\\"off\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\" data-cke-editable=\\"1\\" spellcheck=\\"false\\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\\"true\\"></textarea></span><span class=\\"mq-root-block\\" mathquill-block-id=\\"1\\"><var mathquill-command-id=\\"495\\">&nbsp;y</var><span class=\\"mq-binary-operator\\" mathquill-command-id=\\"497\\">=</span><span class=\\"\\" mathquill-command-id=\\"499\\">−</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"501\\">4</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"503\\">.</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"505\\">9</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"507\\">(</span><var mathquill-command-id=\\"543\\">x</var><span class=\\"mq-binary-operator\\" mathquill-command-id=\\"509\\">−</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"511\\">9</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"513\\">.</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"515\\">1</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"517\\">)</span><span class=\\"mq-supsub mq-non-leaf mq-sup-only\\" mathquill-command-id=\\"539\\"><span class=\\"mq-sup\\" mathquill-block-id=\\"540\\"><span mathquill-command-id=\\"542\\">2</span></span></span><span class=\\"mq-binary-operator\\" mathquill-command-id=\\"521\\">+</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"523\\">1</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"525\\">2</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"527\\">,</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"529\\">4</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"531\\">0</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"533\\">0</span></span></span><span>&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"font-size:20px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\"> gives the estimated height above ground, <em>y</em>, in&nbsp;meters, of a plane, where <em>x</em>&nbsp;is the number of seconds since it started a parabolic maneuver. If this&nbsp;equation is graphed in the <em>xy</em>-plane, which of the following is the best interpretation of the vertex&nbsp;of the graph?</span></span><br>","question":"","options":[{"name":"A","content":"<span style=\\"font-size:20px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">The plane reached an estimated maximum height of 12,400 meters 4.9 seconds after it started&nbsp;the parabolic maneuver.</span></span><br>"},{"name":"B","content":"<span style=\\"font-size:20px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">The plane reached an estimated maximum height of 12,400 meters 9.1 seconds after it started&nbsp;the parabolic maneuver.</span></span><br>"},{"name":"C","content":"<span style=\\"font-size:20px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">The plane reached an estimated maximum height of 4.9 meters 12,400 seconds after it started&nbsp;the parabolic maneuver.</span></span><br>"},{"name":"D","content":"<span style=\\"font-size:20px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">The plane reached an estimated maximum height of 9.1 meters 12.400 seconds after it started&nbsp;the parabolic maneuver.</span></span><br>"}],"correct":"<span style=\\"font-size:20px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">The plane reached an estimated maximum height of 12,400 meters 9.1 seconds after it started&nbsp;the parabolic maneuver.</span></span><br>","solution":""},{"type":"choice","article":"<span class=\\"mq-math-mode\\" latex-data=\\"a\\\\left(9-x\\\\right)=36-4x\\"><span class=\\"mq-textarea\\"><textarea autocapitalize=\\"off\\" autocomplete=\\"off\\" autocorrect=\\"off\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\" data-cke-editable=\\"1\\" spellcheck=\\"false\\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\\"true\\"></textarea></span><span class=\\"mq-root-block\\" mathquill-block-id=\\"1\\"><var mathquill-command-id=\\"4\\">a</var><span class=\\"mq-non-leaf\\" mathquill-command-id=\\"5\\"><span class=\\"mq-scaled mq-paren\\" style=\\"transform: scale(1, 1.2);\\">(</span><span class=\\"mq-non-leaf\\" mathquill-block-id=\\"6\\"><span mathquill-command-id=\\"7\\">9</span><span class=\\"mq-binary-operator\\" mathquill-command-id=\\"8\\">−</span><var mathquill-command-id=\\"9\\">x</var></span><span class=\\"mq-scaled mq-paren\\" style=\\"transform: scale(1, 1.2);\\">)</span></span><span class=\\"mq-binary-operator\\" mathquill-command-id=\\"10\\">=</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"11\\">3</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"12\\">6</span><span class=\\"mq-binary-operator\\" mathquill-command-id=\\"13\\">−</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"14\\">4</span><var mathquill-command-id=\\"15\\">x</var></span></span><span>&nbsp;</span>​​​​​​​<span style=\\"font-size:20px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\"><br>In the given equation,&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\\"mq-math-mode\\" latex-data=\\"a\\"><span class=\\"mq-textarea\\"><textarea autocapitalize=\\"off\\" autocomplete=\\"off\\" autocorrect=\\"off\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\" data-cke-editable=\\"1\\" spellcheck=\\"false\\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\\"true\\"></textarea></span><span class=\\"mq